cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the GMEOW Pipeline slice, please cite GMEOW as below."
title: "GMEOW Build Pipeline Module"
abstract: >-
  The dogfooded-build slice of the GMEOW ontology (core tier). It models the
  project's own build as data: gmeow:Pipeline and gmeow:PipelineStage individuals
  form a directed acyclic graph of typed stages that exchange an in-memory RDF
  dataset rather than re-parsing the GTS bundle per generator. The gmeow-pipeline
  Rust executor reads these individuals back, validates the graph (acyclic,
  complete, exactly one Sink, engine-lock derived), and runs it single-pass,
  making the build a first-class ontological citizen.
